"docg.help": "Troubleshooting and FAQ",
"doc.index.b0": "Interview Realtime Copilot is a Mac app that helps you through real job interviews. It listens to the interviewer, translates as they speak, recognises each question and shows a short answer built from your own resume and notes. It also rehearses with you before the interview and reviews every session afterwards.",
"doc.index.b1": "New here? Install the app, sign in with your website account, create a goal and add your resume — then start a practice session. Every plan includes a monthly AI allowance; no API key is needed.",
"doc.index.b2": "The loop: Prepare, Practise, Perform, Review",
"doc.index.b3": "Everything in the app follows the same four steps for each job you apply for. Go round the loop once per interview.",
"doc.index.b4.0t": "1. Prepare",
"doc.index.b4.0p": "Create a goal (role and company) and add your resume and preparation notes.",
"doc.index.b4.1t": "2. Practise",
"doc.index.b4.1p": "A spoken AI interviewer asks your prepared questions and follows up.",
"doc.index.b4.2t": "3. Perform",
"doc.index.b4.2p": "Go Live in your real interview; the cockpit listens, translates and hints.",
"doc.index.b4.3t": "4. Review",
"doc.index.b4.3p": "Read the debrief and replay the recording, then prepare better next time.",
