"doc.solve-screen.b0.0": "Press ⌥S (or Solve screen in the cockpit) to capture the screen once. The copilot reads the coding problem, diagram or error and writes a solution with its complexity and edge cases.",
"doc.solve-screen.b0.1": "Auto-capture (Settings → Privacy & Stealth) does this by itself when the interviewer asks a coding or system-design question.",
"doc.solve-screen.b0.2": "Defaults → Coding language sets the language solutions are written in.",
"doc.solve-screen.b1": "Screen capture needs the Screen Recording permission. Only one screenshot is taken per request; nothing is recorded continuously.",
"doc.solve-screen.lead": "Let the copilot read the problem on your screen and explain a solution.",
"title.docs-solve-screen": "Coding, system design and screen help — Interview Realtime Copilot Help",
"doc.debriefs.b0.0": "History lists your sessions; open one to read its debrief and play the recording.",
"doc.debriefs.b0.1": "The debrief reviews every question (up to 40 per session): what was missing and a stronger spoken version, using only what you actually said.",
"doc.debriefs.b0.2": "The recording mixes your microphone, the computer audio and the practice interviewer's voice. It is saved when you click End.",
"doc.debriefs.b1": "No debrief? A session needs some of your own speech to review. If the microphone was muted or denied, there is nothing to assess.",
"doc.debriefs.lead": "Every session is recorded on your Mac and reviewed question by question.",
"title.docs-debriefs": "Debriefs and recordings — Interview Realtime Copilot Help",
"doc.privacy.b0.0": "On your Mac: goals, documents, extracted questions, transcripts, debriefs and recordings.",
"doc.privacy.b0.1": "Sent during a session you start: audio and the text needed to answer (the question and relevant passages of your materials), to the speech and language models.",
"doc.privacy.b0.2": "Our server keeps your email, a password hash, your plan and usage amounts. Payments are processed by Stripe.",
"doc.privacy.lead": "What stays on your Mac and what is sent for processing.",
"title.docs-privacy": "Privacy and your data — Interview Realtime Copilot Help",
